{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00070",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.88,
      "end_seconds": 4.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Hi, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.1,
      "end_seconds": 8.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "You're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.84,
      "end_seconds": 18.02,
      "duration_seconds": 9.18,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a fit last month. I don't know what's causing it. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.88,
      "end_seconds": 23.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "How long have you had it? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.24,
      "end_seconds": 36.72,
      "duration_seconds": 11.48,
      "text": "It's been going on for about a week. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.27,
      "end_seconds": 45.32,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.94,
      "end_seconds": 56.66,
      "duration_seconds": 10.72,
      "text": "Yes, missed sleep. That makes it worse. A six out of ten, I suppose. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.28,
      "end_seconds": 60.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "So, anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.78,
      "end_seconds": 82.41,
      "duration_seconds": 18.63,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a bit of confusion afterwards as well. The bit of confusion afterwards? That's been for two weeks. I've been feeling drowsy too, for two weeks. Okay, so I'd been biting my tongue, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.32,
      "end_seconds": 86.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.9,
      "end_seconds": 105.76,
      "duration_seconds": 18.86,
      "text": "Well, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.32,
      "end_seconds": 110.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Have you had any head injury, fever or headache?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.22,
      "end_seconds": 115.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "I haven't had head injury, fever or headache, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.76,
      "end_seconds": 119.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Any weakness on one side or loss of bladder control?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.46,
      "end_seconds": 124.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Hmm, no. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.91,
      "end_seconds": 128.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.33,
      "end_seconds": 132.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.57,
      "end_seconds": 137.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.3,
      "end_seconds": 139.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.55,
      "end_seconds": 144.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.13,
      "end_seconds": 154.09,
      "duration_seconds": 7.96,
      "text": "I take levetiracetam, 500 milligrams, twice a day for the seizures. I take glimepiride, 2 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.78,
      "end_seconds": 157.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "So, do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.68,
      "end_seconds": 168.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "Uh, I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.95,
      "end_seconds": 172.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.33,
      "end_seconds": 189.62,
      "duration_seconds": 16.29,
      "text": "I have epilepsy. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I did try to ignore it for a while. I've had diabetes, yes. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.84,
      "end_seconds": 199.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Yes, I can see the epilepsy in your file as well. Yes, I can see the diabetes in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.74,
      "end_seconds": 205.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Bear with me, I need to finish this line in the notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.43,
      "end_seconds": 222.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Okay, continuing. Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.92,
      "end_seconds": 228.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Well, my father had a heart attack. My grandmother had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.44,
      "end_seconds": 229.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.87,
      "end_seconds": 234.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.11,
      "end_seconds": 236.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.48,
      "end_seconds": 239.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.71,
      "end_seconds": 243.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Alright, I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.93,
      "end_seconds": 253.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.84,
      "end_seconds": 278.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.95,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.8 degrees, SpO2 97 percent on room air, blood pressure 121 over 72. And respiratory rate 18, pulse is 84 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.99,
      "end_seconds": 281.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.95,
      "end_seconds": 283.65,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.38,
      "end_seconds": 287.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Take a breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.48,
      "end_seconds": 301.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "You're alert and orientated, speech is clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.63,
      "end_seconds": 304.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Take a breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.27,
      "end_seconds": 324.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Reflexes and power are symmetrical on both sides."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.46,
      "end_seconds": 327.16,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.6,
      "end_seconds": 358.67,
      "duration_seconds": 28.07,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with breakthrough seizure on known epilepsy at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. A provoked seizure from missed medication is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.29,
      "end_seconds": 369.37,
      "duration_seconds": 10.08,
      "text": "Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a fit last month for about a week, and no head injury or loss of bladder control."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.49,
      "end_seconds": 372.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.49,
      "end_seconds": 376.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.82,
      "end_seconds": 390.37,
      "duration_seconds": 12.55,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.43,
      "end_seconds": 395.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a blood level of the tablet for adherence check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 396.98,
      "end_seconds": 399.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I can book that for Thursday at 2 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.76,
      "end_seconds": 406.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Thursday, that works for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 409.36,
      "end_seconds": 416.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "I'm going to order an EEG, for seizure. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 417.19,
      "end_seconds": 420.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.58,
      "end_seconds": 447.82,
      "duration_seconds": 27.24,
      "text": "We should do an MRI of the brain for seizure. Never skip the tablets, and set a phone alarm if it helps. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you have another seizure lasting more than five minutes. I'd like to see you again after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 448.66,
      "end_seconds": 454.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 456.06,
      "end_seconds": 461.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 462.6,
      "end_seconds": 467.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. All right, I'll let you go. Any final questions first?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 467.74,
      "end_seconds": 470.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Uh, I appreciate your time, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 471.96,
      "end_seconds": 472.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}